You're now building a much more sophisticated retrieval system:

                         Query
                           │
                           ▼
                    Metadata Filter
                           │
              ┌────────────┴────────────┐
              ▼                         ▼
        Keyword Search            Vector Search
              │                         │
              └────────────┬────────────┘
                           ▼
                     Hybrid Ranking
                           │
                           ▼
                         Top-K
                           │
                           ▼
