                           │
                           ▼
                    Context Selection
                           │
                           ▼
                          LLM

This is much closer to how serious search/RAG systems are designed.

One distinction to remember

You now have three different mechanisms:

Technique	Main purpose
Metadata filtering	Where should I search?
Keyword search	Does this exact term occur?
Semantic search	What has similar meaning?
Hybrid search	Combine exact + semantic matching
Reranking	Which candidates are actually most relevant?